  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Air pollution adviser - programme advisory group</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xE5;dgivare i luftv&#xE5;rd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INEC/URBAN har skrivit ett avropsavtal f&#xF6;r 2001 med Lars Nordberg, som r&#xE5;dgivare till INEC i luftv&#xE5;rdsfr&#xE5;gor. Denne har expertkunskaper inom luftv&#xE5;rdsomr&#xE5;det, arbete med regionala luftf&#xF6;roreningar samt internationella konventioner och &#xF6;verenskommelser p&#xE5; luftmilj&#xF6;omr&#xE5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INEC/URBAN has an agreement with Lars Nordberg to use him as an adviser in air pollution issues during 2001.Nordberg has been Executive Secretary for the Convention on Long -range Transboundary Air Pollution and head of &quot;Air and Water Team&quot; at UN-EC</narrative>
  </description>
